What will be the output of the following code snippet?

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int a = 3, b = 5;
    int t = a;
    a = b;
    b = t;
    printf("%d %d", a, b);
    return 0;
}
```

What is the output of the following code snippet?

```c
int main() {
    int sum = 2 + 4 / 2 + 6 * 2;
    printf("%d", sum);
    return 0;
}
```

What will be the output of the following code snippet?

```c
